msgid "TOME@SILVER@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Scarlet Coin"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Fuel your budding trade empire with several new ventures to earn {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.FORTUNE.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}, "
"spend this new-found wealth on powerful mercenaries and exclusive spells "
"costing {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@AUTHOR@NAME"
msgstr "Sahira the Illustrious"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@AUTHOR@DESC"
msgstr ""
"“To follow the Scarlet Road is to follow a ghost. It flows through the heart "
"of our world, but it has officially vanished leaving behind the pattern of "
"its restlessness: counterfeit boarders, unmapped peoples. The road forks and "
"wanders wherever you are. It is not a single way, but many: a web of "
"choices.”"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill1@Name"
msgstr "Crimson Prowlers"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill1@DESC"
msgstr ""
"A {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FIGHTER.Hyperlink} unit specialized in high mobility "
"and bleeding."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill1@Unit@Skill"
msgstr "Taste of Blood"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill1@Unit@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Perform a ferocious bite on a {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLEEDING.Hyperlink} enemy "
"unit, if successful, reset all your cooldowns."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill1@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr "[Mine/] Caravanserai"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill1@Unit@Skill2"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+15 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Unlocks "
"the production of {GLOBAL.UNITS.VARANGIAN_RANGED.Hyperlink}, a powerful "
"mercenary unit with stronger stats than units of its Tier. [bullet/]Counts "
"as a {GLOBAL.MineConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill1@Unit"
msgstr "Ghazi Axeman"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill2@Name"
msgstr "Deploy Rifle"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill2@SKILL@Name"
msgstr "Deploy Axe"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr "Deploy Axe (Reverse)"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill3@Name"
msgstr "Deploy Rifle (Reverse)"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill3@Skill@Name"
msgstr "The Scarlet Road"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill3@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Set up a new trade venture in target Friendly or Independent city: "
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+15 {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink} and +15 {GLOBAL."
"StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink} per turn to target City. [bullet/]+2 "
"{GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} per turn for each Operation Active."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill3@Desc"
msgstr "A Glint of Gold"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill2@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Flaunt a promise of immense riches to target unit, it then jumps to 2 "
"additional targets: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Friendly Units gain 3 {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.FORTUNE.Hyperlink} and +15 {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]Enemy Units suffer {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISTRACTED.Hyperlink} and -15 "
"{GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill4@Name"
msgstr "Pepper Pits"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill4@DESC"
msgstr ""
"\"Come, come on and see, the many wonders of this world.\" [bulletlist] "
"[bullet/] +20 {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL."
"GoldConcept.Hyperlink} per each {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink} in "
"owned city."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill5@Name"
msgstr "Imported Metals"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill5@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Invest on a thiving smith industry, friendly units gain: [bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]+2 {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL."
"DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}. [/bulletlist][br/]{LOC."
"INTERFACE@ENCHANTMENT_NON_REPEATING@INSERT}"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill6@Name"
msgstr "Investment Bubble"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill6@DESC"
msgstr ""
"After 1 turn, units in 1-hex radius: [bulletlist][bullet/]Gain 3 {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.FORTUNE.Hyperlink} if the unit is friendly. [bullet/]Suffer 24 "
"{GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and 2 {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLEEDING."
"Hyperlink} if the unit is hostile."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@Skill6@Group"
msgstr ""
"Set up a new trade venture in target Friendly or Independent city: "
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+15 {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink} and +15 {GLOBAL."
"StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink} per turn to target City. [bullet/]+2 "
"{GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} per turn for each Operation Active."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@PANTHEON@NAME"
msgstr "Ascension: Scarlet Mantle"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@PANTHEON@NAME2"
msgstr "Scarlet Mantle"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@PANTHEON@NAME3"
msgstr "The Gilded Capital"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@PANTHEON@NAME4"
msgstr ""
"I found it as a city of bricks and left it as a city of marvels. [bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]+5 {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL."
"PopulationConcept.Hyperlink} in Governed {GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]+25 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL.RenownConcept."
"Hyperlink} level."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@PANTHEON@NAME5"
msgstr "2"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@EXTRA@NAME"
msgstr "Transform unit into {GLOBAL.UNITS.VARANGIAN_AXE.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@EXTRA@NAME2"
msgstr "Transform unit into {GLOBAL.UNITS.VARANGIAN_RANGED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@EXTRA@NAME3"
msgstr "Ghazi Rifleman"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@EXTRA@NAME4"
msgstr ""
"Set up a new trade venture in target Friendly or Independent city: "
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+15 {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink} and +15 {GLOBAL."
"StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink} per turn to target City. [bullet/]+2 "
"{GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} per turn for each Operation Active."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@EXTRA@NAME5"
msgstr ""
"Deals an extra 12 {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink} damage in 1-hex "
"radius."

msgid "TOME@SILVER@EXTRA@NAME6"
msgstr "The Scarlet Road"

msgid "TOME@SILVER@EXTRA@NAME7"
msgstr "The Scarlet Road"

